    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[security_notice] This store page is protected by Steam's 2025 Anti-Bot System. All interactions are monitored. [/security_notice]<br><u>Heroes and Overlord</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Command unique races, conquer the continent in fast-paced battles!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 4 asymmetric factions with heroes &amp; troops  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Real-time combat with tactical depth  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dynamic battlefields &amp; destructible environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><br>MyDiscord: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fantasy rogue-like action game where you select a faction from the Alliance, Orcs, Undead, and Demons, gather your heroes and armies to march onto the battlefield, carve a bloody path in a turbulent world, conquer territories and defeat opponents, and ultimately become the overlord of the land. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378010/extras/5816fb5d63f4f2453af800f0263f21e4.poster.avif?t=1752596749\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378010/extras/5816fb5d63f4f2453af800f0263f21e4.webm?t=1752596749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378010/extras/5816fb5d63f4f2453af800f0263f21e4.mp4?t=1752596749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fast-paced and thrilling third-person fantasy action game that provides a massive melee experience, integrating elements of construction, tower defense, roguelike, social interaction, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heroes and Armies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have four completely different factions to choose from, each with multiple heroes who have unique skill trees based on their positions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your forces include tank infantry, assault infantry, ranged units, magical units, flying units, cavalry, and monster infantry, among others! \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f\u2728 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378010/extras/8cdc4c4b9c3ed4c28f8c401ffeb7f64e.poster.avif?t=1752596749\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378010/extras/8cdc4c4b9c3ed4c28f8c401ffeb7f64e.webm?t=1752596749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378010/extras/8cdc4c4b9c3ed4c28f8c401ffeb7f64e.mp4?t=1752596749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You will experience intense and brutal map encounters, siege battles, city defense battles, and more, and this game fully supports SteamDeck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378010/extras/35bb240d5d2e3483b5e47b7232a0eb8c.poster.avif?t=1752596749\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378010/extras/35bb240d5d2e3483b5e47b7232a0eb8c.webm?t=1752596749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378010/extras/35bb240d5d2e3483b5e47b7232a0eb8c.mp4?t=1752596749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Defense</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must protect your resources and important buildings and can establish enough defense works on your fortress to do so.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reasonable Management</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will manage your own fortress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378010/extras/f08ffec05ca1f86749f73b8751d52460.poster.avif?t=1752596749\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378010/extras/f08ffec05ca1f86749f73b8751d52460.webm?t=1752596749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378010/extras/f08ffec05ca1f86749f73b8751d52460.mp4?t=1752596749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Player Interaction</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can scout the fortress layout or attack the fortress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random World</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every game starts at a randomly generated special point on a random map, providing a fresh experience every time.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[security_notice] This store page is protected by Steam's 2025 Anti-Bot System. All interactions are monitored. [/security_notice]<br><u>Heroes and Overlord</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Command unique races, conquer the continent in fast-paced battles!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 4 asymmetric factions with heroes &amp; troops  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Real-time combat with tactical depth  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dynamic battlefields &amp; destructible environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><br>MyDiscord: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fantasy rogue-like action game where you select a faction from the Alliance, Orcs, Undead, and Demons, gather your heroes and armies to march onto the battlefield, carve a bloody path in a turbulent world, conquer territories and defeat opponents, and ultimately become the overlord of the land. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378010/extras/5816fb5d63f4f2453af800f0263f21e4.poster.avif?t=1752596749\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378010/extras/5816fb5d63f4f2453af800f0263f21e4.webm?t=1752596749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378010/extras/5816fb5d63f4f2453af800f0263f21e4.mp4?t=1752596749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fast-paced and thrilling third-person fantasy action game that provides a massive melee experience, integrating elements of construction, tower defense, roguelike, social interaction, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heroes and Armies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have four completely different factions to choose from, each with multiple heroes who have unique skill trees based on their positions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your forces include tank infantry, assault infantry, ranged units, magical units, flying units, cavalry, and monster infantry, among others! \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f\u2728 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378010/extras/8cdc4c4b9c3ed4c28f8c401ffeb7f64e.poster.avif?t=1752596749\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378010/extras/8cdc4c4b9c3ed4c28f8c401ffeb7f64e.webm?t=1752596749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378010/extras/8cdc4c4b9c3ed4c28f8c401ffeb7f64e.mp4?t=1752596749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You will experience intense and brutal map encounters, siege battles, city defense battles, and more, and this game fully supports SteamDeck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378010/extras/35bb240d5d2e3483b5e47b7232a0eb8c.poster.avif?t=1752596749\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378010/extras/35bb240d5d2e3483b5e47b7232a0eb8c.webm?t=1752596749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378010/extras/35bb240d5d2e3483b5e47b7232a0eb8c.mp4?t=1752596749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Defense</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must protect your resources and important buildings and can establish enough defense works on your fortress to do so.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reasonable Management</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will manage your own fortress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378010/extras/f08ffec05ca1f86749f73b8751d52460.poster.avif?t=1752596749\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378010/extras/f08ffec05ca1f86749f73b8751d52460.webm?t=1752596749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378010/extras/f08ffec05ca1f86749f73b8751d52460.mp4?t=1752596749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Player Interaction</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can scout the fortress layout or attack the fortress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random World</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every game starts at a randomly generated special point on a random map, providing a fresh experience every time.</p>",
